# The trained plant-disease classification model (disease_model.onnx) will be placed in
# this directory once training finishes in Google Colab.
#
# Nothing loads a model today: disease.classifier.impl defaults to "mock", which is served
# by MockDiseaseClassifier. When the model is ready, drop disease_model.onnx here, implement
# OnnxDiseaseClassifier, and set disease.classifier.impl=onnx. The onnxruntime dependency is
# already in pom.xml, so no build-file change is needed.
